---@field TargetType? aws.elastic_load_balancing_v2.TargetTypeEnum The type of target that you must specify when registering targets with this target group. The possible values are instance (register targets by instance ID), ip (register targets by IP address), lambda (register a single Lambda function as a target), or alb (register a single Application Load Balancer as a target).
---@field ProtocolVersion? aws.elastic_load_balancing_v2.ProtocolVersion [HTTP/HTTPS protocol] The protocol version. The possible values are GRPC, HTTP1, and HTTP2.
